Package: git-hound
Version: 3.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, golang
Section: recon
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/tillson/git-hound
Description: A pattern-matching, patch-attacking, batch-catching secret snatcher
 GitHound hunts down exposed API keys, secrets, and credentials across GitHub
 by pairing GitHub dorks with pattern matching, contextual detection, and
 commit-history analysis. It scans files and repos matching a GitHub dork
 using GitHub's Code Search API and supports commit-history digging.
